/**
 * Maka Event System
 *
 * Events are divided into two categories:
 *
 * 1. Business events
 *    Generated by business services such as OrderService,
 *    ProductService, CartService, StoreService...
 *
 * 2. Behavioral events
 *    Generated by user behavior and recorded through EventService.
 */

